### 1. List products (page 0, size 2)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?page=0&size=2

### 2. Create a valid product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Galaxy Brain Scratching Post",
  "description": "Tall enough to reach the Milky Way",
  "price": 49.90,
  "stock": 15,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "sellerEmail": "posts@cosmo-cats.market"
}

### 3. Invalid product -> 400 problem+json (price 0, no cosmic word, bad email)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Plain Mouse Toy",
  "price": 0,
  "stock": 1,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "sellerEmail": "not-an-email"
}

### 4. Get by id (copy an id from request 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 5. Bad page size -> 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?size=0

### 6. Malformed JSON -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": 

### 7. Delete (copy an id from request 1)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Delivery estimate -> 200 (needs WireMock: ./gradlew wiremockRun). Use a real product id from request 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/delivery-estimate?destination=Mars

### 9. Upstream 503 (Pluto) -> 502 problem+json;  Jupiter = upstream timeout -> 502
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/delivery-estimate?destination=Pluto

### 10. Missing destination -> 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/delivery-estimate
